+ ‘‘Tadāhaṃ sattarajjesu, yaṃ me āsi upāyanaṃ; Tena demi mahādānaṃ,
  akkhobbhaṃ \[akkhobhaṃ (syā. kaṃ.)\] sāgarūpamaṃ.

+ ‘‘Na me dessaṃ dhanaṃ dhaññaṃ, napi natthi nicayo mayi; Sabbaññutaṃ
