#set enum(numbering: "1.", start: 2)
=== Bhūridattacariyā

+ ‘‘Punāparaṃ yadā homi, bhūridatto mahiddhiko; Virūpakkhena mahāraññā,
  devalokamagañchahaṃ.

+ ‘‘Tattha passitvāhaṃ deve, ekantaṃ sukhasamappite; Taṃ
  saggagamanatthāya, sīlabbataṃ samādiyiṃ.

+ ‘‘Sarīrakiccaṃ katvāna, bhutvā yāpanamattakaṃ; Caturo aṅge adhiṭṭhāya,
