+ ‘‘Peḷāya pakkhipantepi, sammaddantepi pāṇinā; Ālampāyane \[ālambaṇe
  (sī.)\] na kuppāmi, sīlakhaṇḍabhayā mama.

+ ‘‘Sakajīvitapariccāgo, tiṇato lahuko mama; Sīlavītikkamo mayhaṃ,
