  pabhindeyyaṃ, catuddīpāna hetupi.

+ ‘‘Api cāhaṃ sīlarakkhāya, sīlapāramipūriyā; Na karomi citte
  aññathattaṃ, pakkhipantampi peḷake''ti.
]

Bhūridattacariyaṃ dutiyaṃ.

