+ ‘‘Vicaranto brahāraññe, ṭhānaṃ addasa bhaddakaṃ; Taṃ ṭhānaṃ
  upagantvāna, tiṭṭhāmi ca sayāmi ca.

+ ‘‘Athettha kapimāgantvā, pāpo anariyo lahu; Khandhe nalāṭe bhamuke,
  mutteti ohanetitaṃ.

+ ‘‘Sakimpi divasaṃ dutiyaṃ, tatiyaṃ catutthampi ca; Dūseti maṃ
  sabbakālaṃ, tena homi upadduto.

+ ‘‘Mamaṃ upaddutaṃ disvā, yakkho maṃ idamabravi; ‘Nāsehetaṃ chavaṃ
