+ ‘‘Adhiṭṭhitamadhiṭṭhānaṃ, tajjento vividhakāraṇā; Na bhindiṃ
  tamadhiṭṭhānaṃ, bodhiyāyeva kāraṇā.

+ ‘‘Mātāpitā na me dessā, attā me na ca dessiyo; Sabbaññutaṃ piyaṃ
  mayhaṃ, tasmā vatamadhiṭṭhahiṃ.

+ ‘‘Ete aṅge adhiṭṭhāya, vassāni soḷasaṃ vasiṃ; Adhiṭṭhānena me samo
  natthi, esā me adhiṭṭhānapāramī''ti.
]

Temiyacariyaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ.

#block[
#set enum(numbering: "1.", start: 7)
=== Kapirājacariyā

+ ‘‘Yadā ahaṃ kapi āsiṃ, nadīkūle darīsaye; Pīḷito susumārena, gamanaṃ
