+ ‘‘Yamhokāse ahaṃ ṭhatvā, orā pāraṃ patāmahaṃ; Tatthacchi sattu
  vadhako, kumbhīlo luddadassano.

+ ‘‘So maṃ asaṃsi ‘ehī'ti, ‘ahaṃpemī'ti taṃ vatiṃ; Tassa
  matthakamakkamma, parakūle patiṭṭhahiṃ.

+ ‘‘Na tassa alikaṃ bhaṇitaṃ, yathā vācaṃ akāsahaṃ; Saccena me samo
  natthi, esā me saccapāramī''ti.
]

Kapirājacariyaṃ sattamaṃ.

#block[
#set enum(numbering: "1.", start: 8)
